{"root":"gertak","ipa":"/ɡər.tak/","core":"威吓、恐吓、威胁，指通过言语或动作使人感到恐惧或屈服。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ɡər.tak/","zh":"威吓、恐吓","phrases":[{"t":"gertak sambal","zh":"虚张声势"},{"t":"kena gertak","zh":"受到威胁"},{"t":"gertak lawan","zh":"威吓对手"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia hanya gertak saja, tidak benar-benar akan memukul.","zh":"他只是虚张声势，并不是真的要打人。"},{"t":"Jangan takut dengan gertakannya.","zh":"不要被他的恐吓吓倒。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"gertak","ipa":"/ɡər.tak/","zh":"威吓","phrase":{"t":"gertak musuh","zh":"威吓敌人"},"example":{"t":"Jangan gertak anak kecil itu.","zh":"不要威吓那个小孩子。"}},{"w":"menggertak","ipa":"/mə.ŋər.tak/","zh":"正在威吓","phrase":{"t":"menggertak orang","zh":"恐吓某人"},"example":{"t":"Dia sedang menggertak bawahannya agar bekerja lebih keras.","zh":"他正在恐吓下属以让他们更努力工作。"}},{"w":"gertakan","ipa":"/ɡər.ta.kan/","zh":"威吓行为、恐吓","phrase":{"t":"gertakan kosong","zh":"空洞的威胁"},"example":{"t":"Gertakannya tidak mempan bagi saya.","zh":"他的恐吓对我不起作用。"}},{"w":"penggertak","ipa":"/pə.ŋər.tak/","zh":"恐吓者","phrase":{"t":"seorang penggertak","zh":"一个恐吓者"},"example":{"t":"Dia dikenal sebagai penggertak di sekolah itu.","zh":"他在那所学校里以恐吓者著称。"}}],"derSlugs":["gertak","menggertak","gertakan","penggertak"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:47:57.640Z","src":"base"}